description:
Design a circuit that converts a 4-bit binary number (input A) into its equivalent decimal value (output X). The output will represent the decimal value of the binary input, calculated by multiplying each bit by its corresponding weight based on its position, and summing these products. The module utilizes combinational logic to perform this conversion whenever the input changes.
module top_module(
    X,
    A
);

code:
module top_module(
    X,
    A
);output reg [3:0] X;
    input [3:0] A;

    // Voltage supply signals
    supply1 KAPWR;
    supply1 VPWR ;
    supply0 VGND ;
    supply1 VPB  ;
    supply0 VNB  ;

    always @ (A) begin
        X = (2**3 * A[3]) + (2**2 * A[2]) + (2**1 * A[1]) + (2**0 * A[0]);
    end

endmodule

