description:
Design a circuit that functions as an 8-to-1 multiplexer. It takes an 8-bit input signal and a 3-bit select line. The output (Y) is determined by the value of the select line (S), which chooses one of the 8 input bits (I[0] through I[7]) to be routed to the output.
module top_module(
  input [7:0] I,
  input [2:0] S,
  output reg Y
);

code:
module top_module(
  input [7:0] I,
  input [2:0] S,
  output reg Y
);always @*
  begin
    case (S)
      3'b000: Y = I[0];
      3'b001: Y = I[1];
      3'b010: Y = I[2];
      3'b011: Y = I[3];
      3'b100: Y = I[4];
      3'b101: Y = I[5];
      3'b110: Y = I[6];
      3'b111: Y = I[7];
    endcase
  end

endmodule

